{"subject_id": "9018144", "chunk_id": "43abeab9f895", "area": "event_area", "context_heading": "PCB产业动态", "date_hint": "2024年5月15日", "global_order": 28, "source": "detail_html", "created_at": "2026-04-02T00:52:21", "source_id": "detail_9018144_0", "order": 22, "used_fallback": false, "event_date_raw": "2024年5月15日", "text": "覆铜板（CCL）涨价，生益科技五月涨价约5%-8%、南亚新材张价4%-5%、华正新材涨价10%-15%、好建滔基层板预计五月下旬至六月开启第二轮涨价"}
